        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been invited to a mysterious dinner party. But alas, it seems you are to be the dinner! Feast of Fools is a turn-based  horror game - escape the haunted house, all while avoiding the endless waves of unspeakable horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Horrors</strong>: No matter how many  you fell, yet more monstrosities  crawl forth from the shadows. They are unending. Stay away from from the eyes in the darkness - when you stare into the abyss, the abyss stares back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape or Perish</strong>: Run, run for the doors! The manor is massive, but if you can get in, you can surely get out. Any who fall behind are lost. Flee, and you may yet survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give Me a Hand</strong>: You must work with your other dinner guests to navigate the haunted halls of the manor. Each guest has their own abilities to push and pull yourselves out of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109740/extras/9027ab2b9a59076871c31de5929fa542.poster.avif?t=1761867615\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109740/extras/9027ab2b9a59076871c31de5929fa542.webm?t=1761867615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109740/extras/9027ab2b9a59076871c31de5929fa542.mp4?t=1761867615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dinner Party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who of our party will survive? And who will be yet more of the feast? Your party must work together to survive, ach in their own manner:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Professor: A student of science. Can pull his allies away from danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lady: The daughter of a lesser baron. Can push her allies forward, towards the doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Priest: The steward of the local church. Can heal his allies. But be warned, he cannot heal himself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109740/extras/d278a16f5502f1f13e998a423de0e8c2.avif?t=1761867615\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109740/extras_big/d278a16f5502f1f13e998a423de0e8c2.webp?t=1761867615 width=1560 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
